000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. DELETE1.
000030 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000040 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000050 FILE-CONTROL.
000060     SELECT TASKS ASSIGN TO "tasks.dat"
000070         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
000080         RELATIVE KEY IS TASK-NO FILE STATUS IS FS.
000090 DATA DIVISION.
000100 FILE SECTION.
000110 FD  TASKS.
000120 01  TASK-REC            PIC X(10).
000130 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000140 01  TASK-NO             PIC 99.
000150 01  FS                  PIC XX.
000160 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000170     OPEN OUTPUT TASKS
